<title>GERMANY: Hochtief nine-mo output up 11 percent.</title>
<headline>Hochtief nine-mo output up 11 percent.</headline>
<text>
<p>ESSEN, Germany, Nov 29, Reuter - Nine months from January to September 1996</p>
<p>(in billions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group construction output	     8.82    up 11.1 pct</p>
<p>    of which domestic			 5.30    up  2.0 pct</p>
<p>    of which international		  3.52    up 28.5 pct</p>
<p>    Incoming orders			   11.76   up 44.3 pct</p>
<p>    of which domestic			 5.75    up 13.8 pct</p>
<p>    of which international		  6.01    up 94.1 pct</p>
<p>    Orders on hand			    14.02   up 32.1 pct</p>
<p>    Staff numbers (headcount)	     42,913  up 4.7 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - International orders include a 2.38 billion mark order for the Athens airport.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
